REM Curated example: report top-K disk usage.

TASK Report top disk-usage paths under a directory
WHY  Quick triage when a partition is filling up.

ON   macos PREFER bsd-tools
ON   linux PREFER gnu-tools

LET  path = /var
LET  topk = 10

DO   list the {topk} largest top-level subdirectories under {path}, sorted by size descending
DO   include human-readable sizes in the output
